   shortened for the calendar; each drawer carries the full session title.

   REBUILT 2026-09-06 (user), the day before the workshop — this is now the
   running order the SOC will actually teach, and it supersedes both PDFs.
   Every session carries its instructor, and the instructor is shown IN the
   calendar cell as well as in the drawer (reversing the 2026-07-16 rule that
   kept speaker names out of the cells — the names are settled now, so the
   calendar can carry them).

   What changed against the 2026-09-05 PDF, day by day:
   · Day 1 — unchanged in shape; every session 10:30 onward is SA Uddin's
     except the GW introduction (Miller). The three afternoon lectures were
     reordered on 2026-09-06 (user) to run Stellar Evolution Endpoints 14:30,
     Compact Object Physics 15:15, then Miller's GW introduction at 16:15
     after the coffee break. The 17:00 lab has a student TA, N. Hafsa.
