     and the closing panel are all dropped. Three morning lectures only, then
     lunch at 12:30, a 14:00 coach from IUB to the ACI Centre, participant
     short talks at 15:00 and the closing ceremony 16:00–18:00, followed by the
     workshop dinner at 19:00 — which is why the grid runs past 18:00 on this
     day alone. The day therefore SPLITS across two venues —
     the morning is still at IUB — which is why sessions can override the
     day's venue.

   Ambiguities in the user's markup were settled by asking (2026-09-06):
   Burke takes the whole 11:45–13:00 block on Day 2 with GW170817 dropped;
   Day 4's FRB lecture starts at 11:45, keeping Thursday's morning coffee;
